WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,110
what do you mean

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,930
One day you won’t be able to sit still in that seat.

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,930
Just add in this line that you are not suspicious of yourself

4
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,130
I won't sit in my seat, I hope you said so

5
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,050
Starting tomorrow, the first three days

6
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,770
But there really has to be a day

7
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,210
Whether you accept it here or not, I will.

8
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,770
We'll discuss the price when the time comes

9
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:29,360
Starting tomorrow, we will go to Highland twice a day.

10
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,760
The first batch Fang Xiaoman Lin Nuo

11
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,880
I let me go to the highlands

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,240
You are at the bottom of the palace

13
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,720
If I don’t send you, who will I send?

14
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,680
The two of us can exchange for that little thing.

15
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:42,500
Who is enough to press the seams? What are you afraid of?

16
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,580
Follow me, I'm sure it will double

17
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,020
Do it yourself again

18
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:51,500
Xiao Tang, are you going to play in the highlands? Sister, won’t you go with me?

19
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,860
Brother Lin Feng said

20
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,620
Take care of your own country first

21
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,700
Okay, okay, everyone knows better than me

22
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:57,900
I'm not sure about this
